%% Repayment Activity
flowchart TD
Start([Start]) --> N0[Select active loan]
N0 --> N1[Enter amount/date/reference]
N1 --> N2[Validate amount ≤ outstanding balance]
N2 --> N3[Persist repayment and recompute balance atomically]
N3 --> N4[If balance is zero transition to COMPLETED]
N4 --> N5[Record REPAYMENT_RECORDED event]
N5 --> N6[Show balance and event status]
N6 --> End([End])
V -- No --> Err[Reject invalid transition; no unauthorized mutation]
V -- Yes --> N1
